  "content": "\n\n<section>\n<div>\n<p>本模組為 Macaw's Mods 與 Nature's Spirit 提供相容性。你是否一直夢想建造一座椰子屋頂……那麼，有了這個模組，現在終於可以實現了！</p>\n<div>\n<p>椰子橋：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1778/622/coconut-bridge-png.png\"></p>\n<p>雪松屋頂：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1778/623/cedar-roof-png.png\"></p>\n<div>\n<p>其他內容：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1778/624/other-stuff-png.png\"></p>\n<section>\n<div>\n<p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用依賴：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></strong></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section></section>",
